   "text": "kd-helpdesk web service (one Docker container)\nGo API: Libredesk + KD code (cmd/kd_*.go)\nVue app built into the same binary\nBackground: IMAP pollers \u00b7 message queues \u00b7\nautomation engine \u00b7 websockets",
   "originalText": "kd-helpdesk web service (one Docker container)\nGo API: Libredesk + KD code (cmd/kd_*.go)\nVue app built into the same binary\nBackground: IMAP pollers \u00b7 message queues \u00b7\nautomation engine \u00b7 websockets",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "r0009",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
