   "updated": 1764150000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "KD features added on top of Libredesk\n\u2022 New ticket form (centered modal): subject, customer + New customer, contact, status, priority, group,\n  assignee, description. Defaults: Open \u00b7 High \u00b7 Support\n\u2022 Customers (companies) linked to contacts and tickets; company contact for tickets raised by a firm\n\u2022 RMAs: agent-created or from the Google Form; status timeline; each RMA gets a ticket\n\u2022 Support dashboard (/api/v1/kd/dashboard)\n\u2022 HubSpot export (companies, contacts, tickets as CSV)\n\u2022 Automation: new email tickets \u2192 group Support, High priority, tag \"Email Support\"\n\u2022 Admin can set an agent's password; Zendesk-like light UI; views in the ticket-list title; collapsible\n  sidebar; KD favicon\n\u2022 Fictional sample data loaded on first boot (kd-demo.example)",
   "originalText": "KD features added on top of Libredesk\n\u2022 New ticket form (centered modal): subject, customer + New customer, contact, status, priority, group,\n  assignee, description. Defaults: Open \u00b7 High \u00b7 Support\n\u2022 Customers (companies) linked to contacts and tickets; company contact for tickets raised by a firm\n\u2022 RMAs: agent-created or from the Google Form; status timeline; each RMA gets a ticket\n\u2022 Support dashboard (/api/v1/kd/dashboard)\n\u2022 HubSpot export (companies, contacts, tickets as CSV)\n\u2022 Automation: new email tickets \u2192 group Support, High priority, tag \"Email Support\"\n\u2022 Admin can set an agent's password; Zendesk-like light UI; views in the ticket-list title; collapsible\n  sidebar; KD favicon\n\u2022 Fictional sample data loaded on first boot (kd-demo.example)",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "r0039",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "r0041",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 1220,
   "y": 900,
   "width": 600,
   "height": 212.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#e03131",
   "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
