   "updated": 1764150000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Blue = Libredesk core tables we use. Green = tables KD added. Arrows point from a table to the one it references (foreign key). ~45 other Libredesk tables (SLAs, macros, help centre, AI, webhooks,\nviews, roles, settings\u2026) are not shown.",
   "originalText": "Blue = Libredesk core tables we use. Green = tables KD added. Arrows point from a table to the one it references (foreign key). ~45 other Libredesk tables (SLAs, macros, help centre, AI, webhooks,\nviews, roles, settings\u2026) are not shown.",
