   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Today on Render's free plan step E can't connect: SMTP ports are blocked, so\nmessages sit at PENDING and then turn FAILED. Upgrading the web service fixes it (no\ncode change).",
   "originalText": "Today on Render's free plan step E can't connect: SMTP ports are blocked, so\nmessages sit at PENDING and then turn FAILED. Upgrading the web service fixes it (no\ncode change).",
