   "text": "ERP adapter\none interface for every app:\nget stock \u00b7 get prices \u00b7 get credit\ncreate order \u00b7 get invoices \u00b7 RMA credit\nnote\n\nIntact adapter now \u2192 new-ERP adapter in\nQ3 2027. Apps never change when the ERP\ndoes.",
   "originalText": "ERP adapter\none interface for every app:\nget stock \u00b7 get prices \u00b7 get credit\ncreate order \u00b7 get invoices \u00b7 RMA credit\nnote\n\nIntact adapter now \u2192 new-ERP adapter in\nQ3 2027. Apps never change when the ERP\ndoes.",
