   "text": "Event processor + sync workers\nread the events outbox and deliver each\nchange:\n\u2022 order.created \u2192 ERP (via adapter)\n\u2022 contact / ticket / order \u2192 HubSpot\n\u2022 rma.created, stock.low \u2192 Teams\n\u2022 dispatched \u2192 customer email\nRetries on failure; every sync logged.",
   "originalText": "Event processor + sync workers\nread the events outbox and deliver each\nchange:\n\u2022 order.created \u2192 ERP (via adapter)\n\u2022 contact / ticket / order \u2192 HubSpot\n\u2022 rma.created, stock.low \u2192 Teams\n\u2022 dispatched \u2192 customer email\nRetries on failure; every sync logged.",
