   "updated": 1764150000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Who owns which data (system of record)\nCustomers, contacts, price bands \u2192 Hub (core)\nCredit limits, invoices, accounting, VAT \u2192 ERP\nStock levels \u2192 ERP; pick/stock-take events \u2192 Mobile Warehouse \u2192 ERP\nOrders \u2192 Hub (sales) until accepted, then ERP\nTickets, RMAs \u2192 Helpdesk (support)\nCalls \u2192 Nuacom \u2192 Hub (calls)\nDeals, marketing \u2192 HubSpot (gets the rest synced in)",
   "originalText": "Who owns which data (system of record)\nCustomers, contacts, price bands \u2192 Hub (core)\nCredit limits, invoices, accounting, VAT \u2192 ERP\nStock levels \u2192 ERP; pick/stock-take events \u2192 Mobile Warehouse \u2192 ERP\nOrders \u2192 Hub (sales) until accepted, then ERP\nTickets, RMAs \u2192 Helpdesk (support)\nCalls \u2192 Nuacom \u2192 Hub (calls)\nDeals, marketing \u2192 HubSpot (gets the rest synced in)",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "r0317",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
