   "text": "\u2022 Helpdesk live, Zendesk cancelled\n\u2022 Move Render to paid plans (email\n  sending, no sleep, DB kept)\n\u2022 Clean customer data\n\u2022 Confirm Zendesk / Experlogix /\n  Intact dates",
