   "text": "\u2022 Hub platform agreed\n\u2022 core schema: move kd_customers +\n  contacts into core.customers\n\u2022 Import customers + products from\n  Intact\n\u2022 ERP discovery: processes, pain\n  points, integration map\n\u2022 HubSpot decision",
