   "text": "1 \u00b7 Apps call the Hub API\n\nHelpdesk, websites, warehouse app send\nREST calls with their own API key (e.g.\nGET /customers/123, POST /orders). They\nnever connect to another app's tables.",
   "originalText": "1 \u00b7 Apps call the Hub API\n\nHelpdesk, websites, warehouse app send\nREST calls with their own API key (e.g.\nGET /customers/123, POST /orders). They\nnever connect to another app's tables.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
