   "text": "3 \u00b7 Webhooks in\n\nSystems that push: Nuacom (call ended),\nGoogle Forms (RMA), HubSpot (contact\nchanged), distributors (stock feed). The\nhub matches them to customers by\nemail/phone/domain.",
   "originalText": "3 \u00b7 Webhooks in\n\nSystems that push: Nuacom (call ended),\nGoogle Forms (RMA), HubSpot (contact\nchanged), distributors (stock feed). The\nhub matches them to customers by\nemail/phone/domain.",
