   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "4 \u00b7 Events out\n\nEvery change writes an event\n(order.created, rma.created, stock.low).\nWorkers deliver it to HubSpot, Teams,\ncustomer emails, the ERP, with retries.",
   "originalText": "4 \u00b7 Events out\n\nEvery change writes an event\n(order.created, rma.created, stock.low).\nWorkers deliver it to HubSpot, Teams,\ncustomer emails, the ERP, with retries.",
